  "hints": [
    "Use a dynamic programming approach.",
    "Define a dynamic programming array\u00a0dp\u00a0of size\u00a0n, where\u00a0dp[i]\u00a0represents the maximum number of jumps from index\u00a00\u00a0to index\u00a0i.",
